%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51fb4c6070f247e48b4377b5728b8182, type: 3}
  m_Name: A12_9
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: We search for clues, anything that could lead us to that other timeline.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: But all we could find, were more people like John, people with dark auras
      who can probably all wield the same dark magic as John.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "They are not the souls of the real people. Either they have eliminated
      and replaced the souls of those people, or they got rid of them and shape shifted,
      so that they would look like them. It\u2019s best if we don\u2019t cross paths
      with them."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 1
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I agree. Last time John mentioned something. He said that the Interdimensional
      spirits will rule over everything. I think that refers to them. Then them corrupting
      and replacing the spirits of the people seems plausible.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Just as we discuss our thoughts while hiding in an alley, someone knocks
      Aleph out.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 3
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c25807cf07d3642429ff3af939d3ec19, type: 3}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: They came out of the shadow, I saw it but it was jus too fast.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Aleph!
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "It\u2019s John again."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: How? We managed to stay hidden from the Interdimensional Spirits until
      now.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Aleph is unconscious. He\u2019s been hit with a shovel on the head and
      is bleeding."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: What are you doing?!
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I kneel down beside Aleph.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Now I finally got you. He wont be standing in my way again. I will finally
      kill you, Sustainer.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8ed5b662bbd7f24449a495e10f7a3ba3, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: What should I do?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Aleph! Please wake up!
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "I try to shake him awake, but it\u2019s no use."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I see blood pooling underneath his head and tears well up in my eyes.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "No! He\u2019ll die!"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Don\u2019t worry, little Sustainer. He will be patched up at the facility
      later. We need this individual after all. Now die!"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8ed5b662bbd7f24449a495e10f7a3ba3, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: He raises his hand and his black magic oozes out.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Wait! Please, I will surrender!
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Ha! You should be ashamed. Do you take no pride in being the Sustainer?
      Hm, it does make things more entertaining, I suppose.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8ed5b662bbd7f24449a495e10f7a3ba3, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "As if I\u2019d just surrender. I\u2019m just trying to stall here."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Well then? How will you beg for your life. Who knows, I might spare you
      if I feel like it.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8ed5b662bbd7f24449a495e10f7a3ba3, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "How about, we answer 3 questions each? After that I will do whatever you
      want. I\u2019ll even let you kill me if I must."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Oh?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8ed5b662bbd7f24449a495e10f7a3ba3, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "I\u2019ll have to shift without closing my eyes this time. And I have
      to be quick."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "I hold Aleph\u2019s head in my lap and pretend like I\u2019m trying to
      have a relaxed conversation with John."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: He laughs at me.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "You are a failure of a Sustainer. The last one was much harder to bring
      down. At least you\u2019re entertaining though. Fine then. State your first
      question."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8ed5b662bbd7f24449a495e10f7a3ba3, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: He sits down comfortably in front of me but forms a circle with his black
      magic around us.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "He\u2019s still ready to attack any time."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Um, why do you need Aleph? You could have just killed him and you didn\u2019t
      even use your black magic."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: He seems to be debating if he should answer me.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Oh well, you\u2019ll die later anyway. I guess it won\u2019t matter. We
      need him to get this universe under control. Your little friend here is the
      core of this universe."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8ed5b662bbd7f24449a495e10f7a3ba3, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: So they are trying to capture each core of every universe?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: John interrupts my thoughts.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Now you answer my question. How did you escape last time? I didn\u2019t
      see you use any power."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8ed5b662bbd7f24449a495e10f7a3ba3, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "He didn\u2019t see? Did the last Sustainer have visible powers?"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Hurry and answer or you\u2019ll die right now."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8ed5b662bbd7f24449a495e10f7a3ba3, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "I, uh, I don\u2019t know! I just ended up somewhere else when you came
      close to me with that magic."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Ugh, I can\u2019t think of a good response without revealing the truth,
      all while simultaneously trying to shift with my eyes open."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Hm. so, you\u2019re clueless? I guess you never got to meet the last Sustainer
      because we killed her before she could teach you anything."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8ed5b662bbd7f24449a495e10f7a3ba3, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Phew, he bought it. He isn\u2019t very sharp, that\u2019s good."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "You may continue with your next question. Though, I must disappoint you,
      I don\u2019t really know much about Sustainers."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8ed5b662bbd7f24449a495e10f7a3ba3, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: He has an evil smirk on his face.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "He must enjoy being the one with the upper hand here, he\u2019s like a
      cat playing with a mouse."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "I have to come up with a plan soon, I don\u2019t have much time left."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I act disappointed and sigh.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Um, then I will ask something else. Aleph mentioned something about two
      different timelines or parallel universes. One where certain events didn\u2019t
      happen. Do you know something about that?"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: 'You never know, he might give some information we can use. '
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: John looks at me with a surprised face for a second and then bursts out
      in laughter.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "What\u2019s so funny?"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: John has tears in his eyes and is gasping for air.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Oh, you crack me up. Don\u2019t tell me this lad thinks he can still meet
      his family? They are definitely gone. Our organisation was responsible for
      that after all."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8ed5b662bbd7f24449a495e10f7a3ba3, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: They were behind the incident with the falling stars??
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: You look shocked. Did he tell you about it? It was necessary for us to
      do that. We are trying to break his mind.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8ed5b662bbd7f24449a495e10f7a3ba3, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "I\u2019m at a loss for words."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: What is he saying? All that pain. The agony. Everything Aleph had to go
      through, was because of those people.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I feel hot rage come up inside of me.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: But I try keeping a calm demeanor.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "You were\u2026 trying to break\u2026 Aleph? Because he\u2019s the core?"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "M-hm. We need them alive but in a state where they can be controlled.
      The first attempt didn\u2019t work. Despite losing his family, he was still
      pretty sane. So we tempered with his mind with the help of our leader, he\u2019s
      very competent, you know. We made him see a fake alternate reality."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8ed5b662bbd7f24449a495e10f7a3ba3, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "I can\u2019t believe it. These bastards."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "I feel frustrated and can\u2019t bring myself to speak another word. I\u2019m
      sure I would start crying if I try."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: What he saw was fake, his parents and everyone else that died that day
      are long gone. But before we could succeed with our plan, the cores were dragged
      out of their universe. Not just this one, a few others from different dimensions
      as well.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8ed5b662bbd7f24449a495e10f7a3ba3, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "\u2026Why?"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "My voice trembled and I couldn\u2019t continue speaking."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Nu-uh. It\u2019s my turn to ask a question now. You better have a satisfying
      reply."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8ed5b662bbd7f24449a495e10f7a3ba3, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "I can\u2019t make him suspicious. And I need to get out of here. Fast.
      Aleph is dying."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I nod and force a smile to try to keep up the carefree vibe from earlier.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Right. Ask away.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "I\u2019m curious. How much do you even know about the role of the Sustainer?
      Tell me everything you know."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8ed5b662bbd7f24449a495e10f7a3ba3, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "What should I do? I\u2019m too worked up to find a good excuse or make
      up a story."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "That\u2019s a big question\u2026"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: You better answer accordingly then. Go.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8ed5b662bbd7f24449a495e10f7a3ba3, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Just then, an idea pops into my mind.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 888f377d03a5ba941952940f8ea0593a, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f70dce0a5c63b94ea50089038fa1f18, type: 2}
